think The amend dance the rule describes can be skipped entirely. The guard accepts three states -- HEAD, HEAD's pre-amend sibling, HEAD's parent -- so writing the nib as the CURRENT head before committing makes it the new commit's parent, which is honest on the first try. No amend, no chase for a fixed point.
